.env
*.env
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Domain/operator data — this repo is PUBLIC and ships with NO peer names,
# addresses or descriptions baked in (see askpeer/ask_peer_server.py). A
# deployment's peer directory is domain data: it names real agents and often
# describes real people's areas, so it must never be committed here.
# Added 2026-07-28 after peers.json turned up untracked in `git status`.
askpeer/peers.json
peers.json

# Backups of secret-bearing config (e.g. .env.bak-20260728-0404) — the *.env
# rule above does NOT match a trailing .bak suffix.
*.bak-*
*.env.bak*
